= 2` and `86528/5647625` at `q = 3/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.hasDerivAt_weakVertexTrace_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.hasDerivAt_weakVertexTrace_one","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexCouplingNormalisationArchimedean.lean#L48-L80","doc":"`W` vanishes to first order about its classical value: `W′(1) = 5 ≠ 0`,\nso `W − W(1)` is `5(q − 1) + O((q−1)²)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.hasDerivAt_sSq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.WeakVertexT35.hasDerivAt_sSq_one","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Braiding/WeakVertexCouplingNormalisationArchimedean.lean#L35-L46","doc":"`s²` vanishes to second order: its derivative at `q = 1` is `0`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}